* A backslash in a dc string ('\', "a\b"): gas's scrubber took \' in quotes for an escaped quote
* and ran the string on ("junk at end of line"), though MRI strings have no escapes; written as
* $5c between the string's parts.
* fixed: 83809c3 2026-10-11 r68togas: backslashes in dc strings
* expect text: 005a5b60 595c0e33 2d5c5c3d 4e714e71
 psect dc_backslash,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.b 0,"Z[`Y",'\',$e,"3-"
 dc.b "\\\\","="
 nop
 ends
